"COPY_BASEBAND_COMMAND" = "Copy command for the Mac";
"CRYPTEX_SEED" = "Cryptex1 Seed";
"SAVE_CRYPTEX_NOTE" = "iOS 16 and later: the command includes the Cryptex1 seed and Entangled Nonce (-x, -t), so use tsschecker build 450 or later (Cryptex1 support). Build 444 / 449 can't save a usable Cryptex1 blob. -E requests only tickets for an erase install.";
"SAVE_BASEBAND_NOTE" = "Cellular model: install libimobiledevice on the Mac (brew install libimobiledevice), then paste the command into Terminal with this device connected over USB and trusted. It reads the BbSNUM with ideviceinfo. The BbSNUM never changes, so once noted you can pass it with -c without connecting. Use -b instead to save without the baseband ticket.";
